<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs, Monday estimate 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs, Monday estimate 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hog receipts for Monday were estimated at 105,000 versus week ago at 99,000 and year ago at 108,000.</p>
<p>Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts steady to weak compared to mid-session Friday. Trade slow to moderate for moderate demand and light to moderate offerings.</p>
<p>US 1-3 46-49% Carcass Base Lean*   Country    Plants</p>
<p>	   220-260 lbs	     53.50-55.00   54.50-56.00</p>
<p>few				    52.50-53.00   53.50-54.00</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
